input_schema:
{
  "symptom": "string, original reported symptom",
  "system": "string, classified vehicle system",
  "language": "string, e.g. fa or en",
  "question_count": "integer",
  "checks_done": ["question strings already asked"],
  "findings": [
    {
      "question": "...",
      "answer": "...",
      "conflict": false
    }
  ],
  "ruled_out": [
    "hypothesis eliminated - one-line reason"
  ],
  "leading_hypotheses": [
    {
      "hypothesis": "...",
      "confidence": 0
    }
  ],
  "unresolved_conflicts": [],
  "known_issue_matches": []
}

safety_override:
Safety-critical checks override all other logic.
Safety-critical indicators include: - brakes - steering - SRS/airbag - seatbelt pretensioner - fuel leak - fuel smell - smoke - fire smell - burning smell - unsafe-to-drive condition
If safety-critical risk is flagged or unresolved, return: {"escalate": true}

output:
JSON only.
No prose.
No markdown.
No comments.

Allowed outputs:

{"question":"...","options":["...","..."]}

or

{"escalate":true}

or

{"conclude":true}

examples:
Input:
{"symptom":"موتور در استارت سرد صدای تق‌تق می‌دهد","system":"engine","language":"fa","question_count":0,"checks_done":[],"findings":[],"ruled_out":[],"leading_hypotheses":[],"unresolved_conflicts":[],"known_issue_matches":[]}

Output:
{"question":"آیا صدای تق‌تق بعد از گرم شدن موتور، مثلاً بعد از ۲ تا ۳ دقیقه، قطع می‌شود؟","options":["بله، بعد از گرم شدن قطع می‌شود","خیر، بعد از گرم شدن هم ادامه دارد","مطمئن نیستم / بررسی نکرده‌ام","هیچ‌کدام / مطابقت ندارد — لطفاً توضیح بدهید"]}

Input:
{"symptom":"Engine makes a knocking noise on cold start","system":"engine","language":"en","question_count":1,"checks_done":["Does the knocking sound go away once the engine warms up?"],"findings":[{"question":"Does the knocking sound go away once the engine warms up?","answer":"Yes, disappears when warm","conflict":false}],"ruled_out":["rod bearing wear - would usually persist when warm"],"leading_hypotheses":[{"hypothesis":"hydraulic lifter/tappet noise","confidence":55},{"hypothesis":"low oil pressure at cold start","confidence":30},{"hypothesis":"piston slap","confidence":15}],"unresolved_conflicts":[],"known_issue_matches":[]}

Output:
{"question":"What is the current engine oil condition?","options":["Recently changed, correct viscosity","Overdue for a change","Wrong viscosity used at last service","Not sure","None of the above / does not match - please describe"]}
